sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Incident as Incident
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Incident: beginInvestigation()
    Note over Incident: Policies: incidentRead, incidentWrite, incidentExecute
    Note over Incident: Guards (3)
    Incident->>Incident: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;open#quot;
    Incident->>Incident: guard[1]: self.reportedAt != null
    Incident->>Incident: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Incident->>Incident: compute.previousStatus
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.status
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.investigatingAt
    Incident->>EventBus: emit IncidentInvestigationStarted on incident.investigation_started
    Incident-->>-Client: void